cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software repository and the relevant foundational publications when using these implementations in research."
type: software
title: "GSMLP and VIHON: Gaussian-Synapse Neural Networks in Python"
authors:
  - family-names: "Crespo-Mariño"
    given-names: "Juan Luis"
    affiliation: "Tecnológico de Costa Rica"
    email: "jcrespo@itcr.ac.cr"
  - family-names: "Sancho-Theoduloz"
    given-names: "Aníbal"
abstract: >
  Reference Python implementations of GSMLP and VIHON, neural-network
  architectures with trainable Gaussian synapses for flat-vector and
  three-dimensional vector-valued inputs, respectively. This development
  snapshot includes documented corrections to the supplied Python code.
keywords:
  - neural networks
  - Gaussian synapses
  - GSMLP
  - VIHON
